### Tupay Ledger & Settlement — manual API walkthrough
### Requires: `php artisan serve`, migrated + seeded DB, Redis, WEBHOOK_SECRET set.
### REST Client: run Login → TOTP → Wallets → set wallet vars → Challenge → Swap → Sign → Settlement.

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token =
@totp =
@eat =
@sourceWalletId =
@destinationWalletId =
@walletId =
@swapAmount = 10000
@settlementAmount = 50000
@providerReference = set_demo_001
@signature =

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "test@tupay.test",
  "password": "password"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Current TOTP (local / testing only)
# @name totpDev
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dev/totp/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
@totp = {{totpDev.response.body.data.totp}}

### List wallets (copy NGN id → sourceWalletId / walletId, CNY id → destinationWalletId)
# @name wallets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
# After wallets response, set manually if auto-pick is unavailable:
# @sourceWalletId = <ngn-wallet-uuid>
# @destinationWalletId = <cny-wallet-uuid>
# @walletId = <ngn-wallet-uuid>

### 2FA challenge → elevated action token (60s TTL, single-use)
# @name challenge
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/2fa/challenge
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "totp": "{{totp}}",
  "action": "swap",
  "action_payload": {
    "source_wallet_id": "{{sourceWalletId}}",
    "destination_wallet_id": "{{destinationWalletId}}",
    "amount": {{swapAmount}}
  }
}

###
@eat = {{challenge.response.body.data.elevated_action_token}}

### Swap (body must match action_payload; EAT header required)
# @name swap
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/swap
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Elevated-Action-Token: {{eat}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "source_wallet_id": "{{sourceWalletId}}",
  "destination_wallet_id": "{{destinationWalletId}}",
  "amount": {{swapAmount}}
}

### Ledger for source wallet
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/{{sourceWalletId}}?per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Sign settlement webhook body (local / testing only) — use the EXACT same JSON for settlement
# @name sign
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dev/webhooks/sign
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "provider_reference": "{{providerReference}}",
  "status": "completed",
  "wallet_id": "{{walletId}}",
  "amount": {{settlementAmount}},
  "currency_code": "NGN"
}

###
@signature = {{sign.response.body.data.signature}}

### Settlement webhook (HMAC over raw body bytes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/settlement
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Signature: {{signature}}

{
  "provider_reference": "{{providerReference}}",
  "status": "completed",
  "wallet_id": "{{walletId}}",
  "amount": {{settlementAmount}},
  "currency_code": "NGN"
}
